WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Direct Speech. Direct speech repeats the exact words of a speaker. Use quotation marks.
Amina said, "I am ready."

2
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Indirect Speech. Indirect speech reports what someone said without quoting the exact words.
Amina said that she was ready.

3
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Pronouns and Time. Check pronouns, verb tense, and time words when reporting speech.
"I will go tomorrow" can become "She would go the next day."

4
00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Try It. Report this sentence: Tunde said, "I like football."
Tunde said that he liked football.
